WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:44.300
"My Secret Vampire"

2
00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:48.930
(Episode 5)

3
00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.040
You're not a kid.

4
00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.440
What kind of nightmare did you have that's
making you too scared to sleep alone?

5
00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:15.830
Hey, that's my spot.

6
00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:17.860
This used to be my room.

7
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:32.880
Hyung, are you asleep?

8
00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:35.230
Yeah.

9
00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:37.700
How can you answer if you're asleep?

10
00:01:39.370 --> 00:01:40.570
I just can.

11
00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.890
But, you know what?

12
00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.020
I can't really sleep on the floor.

13
00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:50.040
Aren't you from the countryside?

14
00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:52.800
We have beds in the countryside, you know!

15
00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.040
Besides, I was pretty pampered growing up.

16
00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:57.720
So?

17
00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:01.310
Nothing, just saying.

18
00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.680
But those star stickers...

19
00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.680
Did your godfather put them up for you?

20
00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.340
Yeah.

21
00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:19.400
You must count the stars
to fall asleep every night.

22
00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.540
I don't sleep well.

23
00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:28.710
I'm not sure when it started,

24
00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.590
but I started having
trouble falling asleep.

25
00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:35.270
The world was so dark,

26
00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.270
and being the only one awake scared me.

27
00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.840
I remember crying so hard.

28
00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:44.090
So he put these up for me.

29
00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:46.890
I'd count the stars all night.

30
00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.470
Over and over again.

31
00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.010
I'd only manage to fall
asleep when the sun came up.

32
00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.140
What are you doing?

33
00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:13.830
This will help you fall asleep easier.

34
00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:21.460
You...

35
00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:25.110
You're just doing this because you don't
want to sleep on the floor, aren't you?

36
00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.560
Mhm.

37
00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:35.590
Next time,

38
00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.330
let's go see the real stars.

39
00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:14.630
Dongha.

40
00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.180
Are you asleep?

41
00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:18.310
Dongha.

42
00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:22.340
I think he's asleep.

43
00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.280
Wait.

44
00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:27.820
What is it?

45
00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:29.456
The rice cakes will get all soggy.

46
00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:30.680
What if they taste bad?

47
00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.259
Why are you bringing
that up all of a sudden?

48
00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:33.486
No, I mean, we might get caught.

49
00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:34.956
It took us forever to earn his trust.

50
00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:37.330
It's better than just
breaking in, isn't it?

51
00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.380
Let's go.

52
00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:40.820
Hey, wait a second.

53
00:04:40.821 --> 00:04:41.920
What now?

54
00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:43.340
Seriously.

55
00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.530
You're not getting addicted
to Dongha's blood, are you?

56
00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.060
Are you serious right now?

57
00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.430
What are you doing coming out of there?

58
00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:02.440
What are you guys doing here?

59
00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:05.270
Hey, let's bolt.

60
00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:10.210
These guys...

61
00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.030
What am I going to do tomorrow?

62
00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:27.850
That's right.

63
00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:31.590
This isn't an invasion of privacy.
It's more like... protecting him.

64
00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:34.590
But if I accidentally ask
too many questions...

65
00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.090
what if I get caught?

66
00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:38.770
Who's going to face the consequences?

67
00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:41.510
Me, that's who.

68
00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.600
Ugh.

69
00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.080
So why did I even come
here in the first place?

70
00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.020
A vampire?

71
00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.360
There's no such thing as vampires.

72
00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:05.510
Do you want to eat that?

73
00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:10.440
They actually have it?

74
00:06:11.320 --> 00:06:12.520
I'll have this, please.

75
00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:18.250
The vampire hyung said he'd buy it for me.

76
00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.510
Oh... You mean the Vampire Berry Juice?

77
00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:27.490
I'm in Class 1 of the second
grade at Songhwa Elementary.

78
00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.670
Kim Won-ji, from the gifted class.

79
00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:33.230
Do you know him?

80
00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:35.369
Should you be eating something
bought by a hyung you don't know?

81
00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.870
He's not a stranger.

82
00:06:37.070 --> 00:06:38.250
This hyung is...

83
00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.350
A vam...

84
00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.600
I'll have an Americano.

85
00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.806
Didn't you say you don't sleep
well? Why are you drinking coffee?

86
00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.110
You should be drinking tea. Tea.

87
00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.470
When do you get off work?

88
00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.250
Are you going to wait for me?

89
00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.700
No, um...

90
00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.810
We have to wait for this
kid's parents to show up.

91
00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:09.050
I'm getting off soon.

92
00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:12.256
If there's anything you want to eat,
just ask this hyung to buy it for you.

93
00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.280
Got it?

94
00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:17.590
Um... But Mr. Vampire.

95
00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:18.940
Can I ask you something?

96
00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.340
You like that other hyung,

97
00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:23.580
don't you?

98
00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.080
Me?

99
00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:26.770
What makes you say that?

100
00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.940
You can't hide it when you like someone.

101
00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:31.800
It's written all over your face.

102
00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.370
Is that what they're teaching
in the gifted class these days?

103
00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:39.230
From what I can see,

104
00:07:39.410 --> 00:07:41.250
he likes you too.

105
00:07:43.340 --> 00:07:44.540
You guys have a good shot.

106
00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:03.300
What?

107
00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.540
Like this?

108
00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:16.970
Give it a try.

109
00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:22.850
One more time.

110
00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:25.600
Hold the ball, and then...

111
00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:30.700
It went in!

112
00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.790
Should we head back?

113
00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:45.270
Sure.

114
00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.400
Oh, thank you.

115
00:08:49.780 --> 00:08:50.846
Want to play a game with us?

116
00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:52.430
No thanks, we were just about to leave.

117
00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.110
So, are we going home now?

118
00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.090
Nope.

119
00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.370
Why not?

120
00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:43.650
I've thought about it.

121
00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.950
The reason I can't sleep at night...

122
00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.440
is probably because I'm not
active enough during the day.

123
00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:50.470
So today,

124
00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:52.040
I want to stay out a little longer.

125
00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:54.200
Really? Okay, well...

126
00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.880
I guess I'll head back by myself then.

127
00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:01.700
Isn't there anything
you want to do in Seoul?

128
00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:04.990
It's just that every day,

129
00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:06.860
you're either at home

130
00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.090
or at work.

131
00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:11.010
Isn't that an invasion of my privacy?

132
00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.210
Actually...

133
00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.080
there is something I want to do.

134
00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:08.180
Hey, that was super fun, right?

135
00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:11.070
Why didn't you join in earlier?

136
00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:12.670
Play with us next time, okay?

137
00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:14.300
No.

138
00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.150
Sheesh, that's just how humans are.

139
00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:17.570
He's actually pretty good.

140
00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:18.716
Not as good as me, of course,

141
00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:19.740
but still, not bad.

142
00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.280
I just don't want to play.

143
00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.080
Why?

144
00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.980
Don't you like playing basketball?

145
00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.680
Come on, play with us.

146
00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.620
- Next time, let's be on the same team and crush them.
- I don't like it.

147
00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:34.070
What's wrong with you?

148
00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.130
Who said that?

149
00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.540
That I like basketball?

150
00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.180
Well, we used to play
together all the time,

151
00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:43.320
so I just... I assumed you liked it too.

152
00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.660
I only played because it was with you.

153
00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:48.940
What?

154
00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.030
I played because you liked it.

155
00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:52.860
I'm not really interested in ball sports.

156
00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.640
You're so clueless, you jerk.

157
00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.080
A bracelet.

158
00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:15.840
I think it really suits you.

159
00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.110
Han Dongha.

160
00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:26.050
Come here for a second.

161
00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.330
Okay, what is it?

162
00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.280
Excuse me.

163
00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:49.949
I really love your style.

164
00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.380
Can I take a picture?

165
00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:52.710
Sure.

166
00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.220
Could you stand over here, please?

167
00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.440
Ready?

168
00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:00.550
One, two.

169
00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:05.480
Would your friend like
to be in a picture too?

170
00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.110
- Oh, no thank you.
- Sure.

171
00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:15.620
Okay.

172
00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.010
Here we go.

173
00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:18.330
One.

174
00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.330
Two.

175
00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.270
Is this what you wanted to do?

176
00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:29.270
Wow.

177
00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.126
You really didn't want
to take that picture, huh?

178
00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:33.226
You were practically
shooting lasers from your eyes.

179
00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.930
There was something wrong with the camera.

180
00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:36.430
I'm keeping this one, then.

181
00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:39.920
Is there anything else you want to do?

182
00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:41.700
Well...

183
00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.450
There's a lot.

184
00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:45.490
I want to learn how to skateboard.

185
00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:48.100
Oh, and I want to see the ocean.

186
00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.480
Why the ocean all of a sudden?

187
00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.370
Because I've never been
to the ocean in my life.

188
00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.140
Mmm.

189
00:13:58.130 --> 00:13:59.130
Oh?

190
00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.280
The last bus is coming.

191
00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:37.730
We missed it.

192
00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:03.820
What do we do now?

193
00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:06.850
There should be taxis, right?

194
00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:33.610
"My Secret Vampire"

195
00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:34.749
One.

196
00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:35.750
Two.

